        "description": "She is in charge of planning in the 'Second Development Section' and has been with the company for three years. [Shinozaki](https://anilist.co/character/166995/Shinozaki-Takuma), who works in the same team, is the 'only junior staff member' for her and she cares about her in some way.\n\nHer favourite animal is a cat. She is somewhat cat-like herself, and often \"catnames\" people she likes when she gets close to them or when a tasty-looking meal is brought to her.\n\nShe is a reliable older woman who cooks and does her housework well. However, she has never had a boyfriend = she has always been old enough to have one.",
